WEBVTT

00:07.310 --> 00:09.690
Huh? What is this?

00:13.640 --> 00:15.360
Hey. Hey!

00:19.570 --> 00:20.970
Where are we?

00:21.970 --> 00:23.830
We're inside the <i>Archimedes</i>.

00:25.660 --> 00:26.860
You...

00:26.860 --> 00:29.000
I knew you'd be great.

00:29.500 --> 00:31.360
Who the hell are you?

00:31.360 --> 00:35.130
Won't you please become my dolls?

00:35.720 --> 00:36.670
Huh?

00:36.670 --> 00:40.970
Despite being so weak, 
you're not afraid to die.

00:40.970 --> 00:43.910
I bet you'd make a great doll couple.

00:43.910 --> 00:44.640
What?!

00:44.640 --> 00:46.870
What are you talking about?

00:46.870 --> 00:49.650
And I'd never be part of 
a couple with this shrimp!

00:50.300 --> 00:51.770
Don't worry.

00:51.770 --> 00:55.160
It's a good deal for you two, too.

00:55.160 --> 01:01.410
Because once you're my dolls,
you'll become way stronger than you are now.

01:03.200 --> 01:07.540
Currently, you have no chance of winning,

01:07.540 --> 01:10.660
but once your abilities are 
awakened by my doll ability,

01:10.660 --> 01:12.800
winning will no longer be just a dream.

01:13.620 --> 01:17.050
What is she talking about?

01:17.770 --> 01:21.610
So, here. Wear these flowers.

01:22.850 --> 01:24.680
Then say, "Long live Verdi!"

01:25.270 --> 01:27.140
You just have to shout it three times.

01:27.140 --> 01:30.020
Go on, try it. Go on.

01:30.020 --> 01:31.800
Don't be ridiculous!

01:31.800 --> 01:35.800
I'll never believe a fishy 
offer like that again!

01:35.800 --> 01:38.450
Aw, but I'm not lying.

01:38.450 --> 01:40.660
Shut up, you con artist!

01:50.500 --> 01:52.690
Why do we have to wear these clothes?

01:54.830 --> 01:56.530
Don't worry.

01:56.970 --> 01:59.020
Wangnan and the others are competing.

01:59.020 --> 02:03.180
And most of all, you have 
the new Prince with you.

02:03.180 --> 02:05.430
You can watch from the sidelines.

02:05.760 --> 02:07.850
Long live Verdi.

02:09.860 --> 02:11.730
Long live Verdi.

02:12.090 --> 02:13.880
Isn't that...

02:14.840 --> 02:15.710
Stop!

02:15.710 --> 02:17.740
Long live Verdi!

02:24.890 --> 02:26.000
Miseng...

04:00.970 --> 04:04.970
<b>Episode 18</b>

04:00.970 --> 04:04.970
<b>The Mad Dog and the Lizard</b>

04:20.630 --> 04:21.740
Miseng...

04:27.010 --> 04:29.490
We'll take out that weak-looking one first.

04:29.830 --> 04:30.850
Miseng!

04:45.970 --> 04:48.050
What's going on?

04:52.190 --> 04:54.560
This game is mine.

04:55.960 --> 04:59.320
What did that puppeteer do to Miseng?

05:02.270 --> 05:06.320
Oh? Oh? What's this?

05:06.840 --> 05:08.570
She's on a rampage.

05:10.730 --> 05:13.670
This is unexpected!

05:13.670 --> 05:20.590
The girl thought to be the weakest 
eliminated two competitors right off the bat!

05:21.530 --> 05:25.340
Prince! Prince! Prince!

05:25.690 --> 05:28.540
That hurts. I'm injured, you know.

05:28.540 --> 05:30.850
What happened to Miseng?!

05:31.150 --> 05:35.560
Those flowers made her lose her mind.

05:39.310 --> 05:42.250
He's outta here!

06:01.480 --> 06:04.130
We can't attack a teammate!

06:05.430 --> 06:06.680
Those guys...

06:07.980 --> 06:09.390
Miseng...

06:12.620 --> 06:14.310
At this rate...

06:14.600 --> 06:16.040
Hey, Prince!

06:16.450 --> 06:20.730
Can't we turn her back to normal by 
taking those flowers or something?!

06:20.730 --> 06:23.610
I mean, it's possible...

06:23.610 --> 06:25.860
Then we've gotta take them!

06:25.860 --> 06:28.600
Wait, idiot! You massive idiot!

06:28.600 --> 06:31.030
There's no guarantee it'll work!

06:31.260 --> 06:34.740
If we screw up, she could kill us.

06:35.220 --> 06:38.130
You've fallen far, Prince.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.330
Huh?

06:39.770 --> 06:43.290
You boasted about achieving 
independence from your dad

06:43.290 --> 06:48.850
and becoming an adult and new Prince,
but you can't even beat Miseng as a doll?

06:50.590 --> 06:53.720
How have you become an adult?

06:53.720 --> 06:55.310
You jerk...

06:55.560 --> 07:01.820
If it bothers you, then restore Miseng 
and prove you're the new Prince.

07:02.950 --> 07:05.570
Fine. I'll do it.

07:05.570 --> 07:10.070
The new Prince isn't afraid of dolls!

07:17.940 --> 07:19.580
Triple Stopper!

07:25.620 --> 07:27.050
A single blow...

07:32.690 --> 07:36.340
That's another one out of the park!

07:37.230 --> 07:38.560
Thanks.

07:39.990 --> 07:45.310
So we can't do anything without help, huh?

07:46.040 --> 07:49.820
Is the new Prince really so powerless?

07:49.820 --> 07:52.400
Don't underestimate me!

07:56.240 --> 07:57.330
He stopped her!

07:57.810 --> 08:00.660
Reel Inventory Interlocking Technique!

08:00.660 --> 08:04.610
Purple Lure! New Prince Special!

08:07.030 --> 08:10.800
See that? I stopped you. I am strong.

08:10.800 --> 08:15.430
I don't need to borrow strength from anyone,
unlike someone I know.

08:17.550 --> 08:18.970
You listen to me.

08:18.970 --> 08:23.560
People who always rely on others 
will remain weak for life.

08:26.050 --> 08:32.820
Do you think Lord Devil and Viole 
are gone because you're weak?

08:35.690 --> 08:39.450
You still can't forget that 
your parents abandoned you?

09:03.480 --> 09:05.190
Not bad.

09:23.510 --> 09:24.770
Don't go.

09:27.450 --> 09:31.460
I promise I'll get stronger, so don't go.

09:32.210 --> 09:34.570
Where do you think we're going?

09:35.880 --> 09:38.990
You still need someone to take care of you.

09:46.270 --> 09:49.110
The first round is over!

09:49.110 --> 09:55.150
The winners are Hon Akraptor, 
Ja Wangnan, and Prince!

09:55.150 --> 09:57.110
Seriously?

09:59.630 --> 10:04.520
Does everyone understand the rules now?

10:04.520 --> 10:06.430
For the rest of the game...

10:06.430 --> 10:11.380
All five groups will compete at once.

10:11.380 --> 10:14.690
Enjoy yourselves to your hearts' content!

10:21.260 --> 10:22.200
Viole.

10:23.340 --> 10:25.040
Did you see that, Viole?

10:25.460 --> 10:28.530
That's the true power of the New Prince!

10:29.280 --> 10:31.650
You're next! You got that?

10:31.650 --> 10:32.760
Hey.

10:32.760 --> 10:36.430
I grow every day! I'm a grower!

10:36.430 --> 10:39.030
I'll drag you back if I have to!

10:39.030 --> 10:40.790
Quit it.

10:40.790 --> 10:42.920
You say something, too.

10:42.920 --> 10:45.260
Like what? Uh...

10:47.310 --> 10:48.980
Jue Viole Grace.

10:50.180 --> 10:52.170
I will crush FUG.

10:54.060 --> 10:56.990
That's a declaration of war!

10:56.990 --> 10:59.300
Now that's funky!

11:01.380 --> 11:02.930
Let's go.

11:07.410 --> 11:08.560
Hey...

11:08.930 --> 11:11.540
Is she really okay?

11:13.570 --> 11:15.340
There's nothing to worry about.

11:15.940 --> 11:18.720
You con artist!

11:18.720 --> 11:22.870
She just lost control of the 
power she suddenly gained.

11:22.870 --> 11:25.940
More importantly, I was so moved!

11:25.940 --> 11:30.260
You risked your life to save the one you love!

11:30.260 --> 11:32.510
I told you, it's not love!

11:32.510 --> 11:34.890
Won't you please become my doll?

11:34.890 --> 11:37.430
I-I said no!

11:37.430 --> 11:39.050
Don't say that! Please!

11:37.580 --> 11:38.700
Horyang?

11:39.050 --> 11:42.890
No! Let go! Let go of me!

11:39.890 --> 11:42.100
Come on, put the flower on!

11:42.890 --> 11:44.180
Say it!

11:44.180 --> 11:45.100
Stop!

11:47.750 --> 11:50.370
The next list of competitors 
has been announced.

11:50.730 --> 11:52.270
That's me!

11:50.730 --> 12:03.740
<b>Group 4 Participants

 Horyang
 Chang Blarode
 Pon Ten
 Goseng
 Jane Drawny
 Polystar
 Cookie
 Sechil</b>

11:50.730 --> 12:03.740
<b>Group 5 Participants

 Yeon Yihwa
 Quaetro Blitz
 Bond
 Toll Bia
 Cueto
 Sean
 Seven
 Moonzo</b>

11:52.270 --> 11:56.330
Ugh! Isn't Quaetro that crazy fire user?

11:56.330 --> 11:57.760
I'm there, too.

11:57.760 --> 12:00.740
You're in the same group as Lord Devil.

12:00.740 --> 12:03.740
That dangerous guy with the 
scar on his eye is there, too.

12:06.740 --> 12:12.000
<b>Group 4 Participants

 Horyang
 Chang Blarode
 Pon Ten
 Goseng
 Jane Drawny
 Polystar
 Cookie
 Sechil</b>

12:06.740 --> 12:12.000
<b>Group 5 Participants

 Yeon Yihwa
 Quaetro Blitz
 Bond
 Toll Bia
 Cueto
 Sean
 Seven
 Moonzo</b>

12:06.740 --> 12:12.000
<b>Group 6 Participants

 Varagarv
 Den Blian
 Rouble
 Amaguta
 Bebe
 Fonti
 Gas Ville
 Chu Ahn</b>

12:07.830 --> 12:12.000
Yama's mad dog has finally shown up...

12:13.040 --> 12:14.230
Varagarv.

12:25.130 --> 12:28.650
<i>They're probably all expecting 
the four-eyes to drop out, but...</i>

12:34.390 --> 12:35.190
Huh?

12:38.450 --> 12:40.400
Horyang?

12:42.390 --> 12:43.930
Are you all right?

12:43.930 --> 12:47.410
All the strength went out of my legs.

12:51.410 --> 12:54.540
Love on the battlefield is a beautiful thing.

12:56.930 --> 12:58.170
Don't worry.

12:58.660 --> 13:00.540
I don't intend to fight you.

13:01.500 --> 13:05.430
And we're not the stars of the show, anyway.

13:15.190 --> 13:15.940
Huh?

13:16.310 --> 13:18.320
Why aren't you burning?

13:18.320 --> 13:20.620
Because I use fire, too.

13:20.620 --> 13:23.280
You do? We're the same type?

13:23.280 --> 13:24.800
We are not the same.

13:24.800 --> 13:28.000
I don't use fire as recklessly as you do.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.880
What are you talking about?

13:29.880 --> 13:32.600
What's better than using fire recklessly?

13:32.600 --> 13:33.740
You're wrong.

13:33.740 --> 13:36.580
Fire must be used carefully and thoughtfully,

13:36.580 --> 13:38.590
or you could do something 
that can't be undone.

13:38.590 --> 13:40.830
Oh, I get it.

13:40.830 --> 13:44.100
You're afraid of your own fire, aren't you?

13:44.790 --> 13:46.010
You can't assume that.

13:46.010 --> 13:47.340
Okay, okay.

13:47.670 --> 13:50.960
Anyway, there's a match I want to watch.

13:56.500 --> 13:57.850
That's...

14:00.890 --> 14:02.620
Yama's mad dog.

14:05.250 --> 14:09.110
Who decided he's the 
strongest E-rank Regular?

14:13.510 --> 14:15.200
This is incredible!

14:15.200 --> 14:20.380
Not a single person is stopping 
him from inserting his flag!

14:24.300 --> 14:27.090
I challenge the strongest E-rank Regular!

14:27.090 --> 14:29.890
I am Amaguta of the warrior people!

14:32.540 --> 14:34.790
Don't throw your life away.

14:35.350 --> 14:36.640
What's this?

14:36.640 --> 14:39.520
The mad dog passed right by 
him as though to ridicule him!

14:39.520 --> 14:41.930
He completely ignored him!

14:41.930 --> 14:44.840
Perhaps this means he wouldn't 
stand a chance against him.

14:44.840 --> 14:47.060
Now <i>that's</i> funky!

14:48.280 --> 14:50.280
You damn mongrel!

14:55.940 --> 14:57.190
<i>He didn't even use his baang.</i>

14:58.950 --> 15:00.620
An overwhelming victory!

15:00.620 --> 15:03.110
He truly is the strongest E-rank Regular!

15:03.110 --> 15:05.530
After defeating an enemy 
without using his hands,

15:05.530 --> 15:10.630
he advances to the team tournament!

15:13.490 --> 15:17.960
He was originally kept as a fighting dog.

15:20.180 --> 15:21.390
A fighting dog.

15:21.840 --> 15:28.110
Slayer Baylord Yama operates 
a secret dog-fighting ring.

15:28.110 --> 15:31.400
The warriors who fight there 
are called fighting dogs.

15:32.600 --> 15:36.610
In order to demonstrate their strength,

15:36.610 --> 15:41.940
Baylord chose three young fighting 
dogs to take the tests as Regulars.

15:42.970 --> 15:45.830
Varagarv was one of them.

15:45.830 --> 15:47.750
And in the blink of an eye...

15:48.220 --> 15:50.670
He came to be called the 
strongest E-rank Regular.

15:50.970 --> 15:58.680
However, one day he quit climbing 
the Tower and cut ties with FUG.

15:58.980 --> 16:05.440
Now he hates FUG and slaughters 
every Regular associated with them.

16:05.440 --> 16:08.440
Then the reason he came here...

16:09.620 --> 16:12.260
...was to kill you, Viole.

16:17.540 --> 16:18.900
He left it loose on purpose.

16:27.560 --> 16:34.470
<b>Hatz
Tell me how to get out of here.</b>

16:29.940 --> 16:34.470
<b>Emily
 Look under the bed.</b>

16:31.280 --> 16:34.020
This is the reason this happened 
to me in the first place.

16:41.100 --> 16:45.730
As we reach the midpoint, 
things are heating up even more!

16:45.730 --> 16:50.740
The expressions of the gamblers 
are beginning to change, too!

16:50.740 --> 16:54.990
Who will claim the leader's 
seat in the team tournament?

16:54.990 --> 16:58.740
It's time to announce the 
next set of competitors.

16:59.100 --> 17:01.750
<b>Group 18 Participants

 Vuilcan
 Centrol
 Roll Decone
 Gurgia
 Perla Iran
 Yuki
 Van Slyder
 Do Irae</b>

16:59.100 --> 17:01.750
<b>Group 19 Participants

 Jue Viole Grace
 Denba
 Misha Crukina
 Kroh
 Vanega
 Rotto
 Shiple
 Condo</b>

17:02.040 --> 17:05.540
Whoa, it's Jue Viole Grace!

17:05.540 --> 17:08.250
The Slayer Candidate finally 
makes his appearance!

17:08.560 --> 17:11.480
It's still early. Try to hold back.

17:11.480 --> 17:13.880
I will. I'll be back.

17:14.360 --> 17:15.310
Bam...

17:19.510 --> 17:21.350
<i>I just have to insert my flag.</i>

17:21.850 --> 17:23.650
<i>I'll end this as quickly as possible.</i>

17:24.430 --> 17:26.870
Let the game begin!

17:32.760 --> 17:35.040
Go ahead, Viole!

17:36.840 --> 17:39.290
We're your followers.

17:39.710 --> 17:43.240
We won't let anyone stop you 
until you insert your flag.

17:43.240 --> 17:44.450
Let's go!

17:47.370 --> 17:49.540
Those are fake followers.

17:49.540 --> 17:50.380
Huh?

17:50.380 --> 17:57.630
Making a show of being Viole's allies 
makes it harder for others to attack them.

17:59.050 --> 18:02.130
He doesn't like fighting, right?

18:03.080 --> 18:05.690
Then it's not a bad deal for him.

18:08.020 --> 18:09.390
What are you doing?

18:10.210 --> 18:10.890
Huh?

18:11.580 --> 18:13.760
I will advance with my own strength,

18:13.760 --> 18:16.550
so do you mind not worshiping me?

18:16.550 --> 18:20.910
No matter what you say, 
we are your followers!

18:24.050 --> 18:26.290
What are you doing?

18:28.460 --> 18:31.290
What's the meaning of this?

18:32.630 --> 18:38.050
I'm not some convenient god 
who will grant your wishes.

18:38.550 --> 18:40.810
Will you still worship me?

18:44.000 --> 18:46.180
Well, good luck.

18:51.200 --> 18:52.240
That's what I expected.

18:55.100 --> 18:56.360
I knew it.

18:57.250 --> 19:01.700
It was instantaneous before, too, 
but I got a good look at his eyes.

19:04.060 --> 19:08.010
They resemble those of the guy 
who died on the 2nd floor.

19:08.720 --> 19:09.930
Huh.

19:15.090 --> 19:20.840
<b>Jue Viole Grace</b>

19:15.570 --> 19:20.840
<i>All data on Viole has been deleted, 
making his past a mystery.</i>

19:21.650 --> 19:24.490
<i>I'd like to confirm his identity right away,</i>

19:26.210 --> 19:28.640
<i>but there's always a FUG member with him.</i>

19:30.040 --> 19:33.530
<i>The princess of Jahad against 
a Slayer Candidate.</i>

19:34.080 --> 19:36.610
<i>Who wouldn't want to watch that?</i>

19:36.970 --> 19:41.130
<i>But perhaps during the party 
after the individual battles...</i>

19:42.690 --> 19:45.180
I told you to hold back.

19:45.180 --> 19:46.460
Sorry.

19:47.410 --> 19:49.260
Why's rabbit-ears with you?

19:49.670 --> 19:51.890
I was competing, too.

19:51.890 --> 19:52.980
Did you lose?

19:52.980 --> 19:56.090
I advanced. Come on, move.

19:57.210 --> 19:59.260
And don't ever say that again.

19:59.990 --> 20:04.540
Nobody needs a god who doesn't grant wishes.

20:08.210 --> 20:12.320
FUG is definitely hiding Viole's past.

20:12.320 --> 20:17.520
And the guys in group one said 
they'd take Viole back.

20:18.550 --> 20:23.310
Viole tried to hide his identity 
when he fought the princess's team.

20:24.960 --> 20:29.310
People who know Viole's past 
are definitely competing, too.

20:29.310 --> 20:34.040
Then why did FUG have Viole 
compete in the Workshop Battle?

20:34.520 --> 20:37.580
Why risk his past being discovered?

20:45.640 --> 20:48.600
That guy's not human.

20:50.100 --> 20:52.110
What an unbelievable battle!

20:52.110 --> 20:56.560
You can't take your eyes 
off this powerful matchup!

21:05.000 --> 21:07.310
<i>They're all fighting for something.</i>

21:07.800 --> 21:09.620
<i>They're all wishing for something.</i>

21:09.990 --> 21:11.630
<i>So what am I doing?</i>

21:12.910 --> 21:15.150
<i>Where are you, Rachel?</i>

21:25.050 --> 21:30.990
So, 48 competitors from 26 
groups have advanced so far.

21:30.990 --> 21:34.810
Only one last match remains.

21:34.810 --> 21:41.200
Who will claim the final 
ticket to the tournament?

21:41.690 --> 21:46.200
It's time to announce the 
final three group lists!

21:46.510 --> 21:54.200
<b>Group 29 Participants

 Anaak Jahad
 Khun Ran
 Dabi
 Michael</b>

21:48.480 --> 21:54.690
What's this? Two of the top five E-rank 
Regulars are in the same group!

21:55.110 --> 21:56.360
That lizard, huh?

21:58.390 --> 21:59.950
That blue-haired kid, huh?

22:00.780 --> 22:03.320
Now we can finally settle the score.

23:38.520 --> 23:40.480
Don't fight here.

23:39.040 --> 23:41.250
<b>Next Time</b>
